### 0. Speaker Identification

**Host/Moderator** — Unnamed host, clearly an Improving employee. Asks questions, prompts Robin, and contributes genuine observations of their own (the David Allen psychic weight reference, the 64% shadow IT stat, the non-determinism insight about LLM temperature, the delegation framing). Host lines are not filler — they contribute to the conversation. Attribution below will distinguish host observations from Robin's.

**Guest/SME — Robin Fuentes** — President, Houston Enterprise (South Texas), Improving. Primary expert voice. Speaks from hands-on experience building personal agentic workflows and leading an enterprise with active AI adoption concerns.

