#### H2: The data exposure hiding in your employees' personal accounts

- H3: What "we haven't adopted AI" actually means for your data
  - Section note: The 64% / 232 incidents stat goes here. The article argues this directly: organizational inaction is not a conservative data posture. It is an uncontrolled one.
